cycle The Voyage Home

direction-counterclockwise
autonumber
center VOYAGE

Provision green
  Water, pork and powder
  -Hold is full-> color: green

Set Course blue
  The Navigator marks the chart
  -Fair winds-> color: blue

Engage orange
  Run down the merchantman
  -Prize taken-> color: orange
  -Outgunned-> Set Course color: red

Plunder purple
  Strip the hold of silver
  -Heavy laden-> color: purple
  -Too little-> Engage color: yellow

Landfall teal
  Drop anchor at Tortuga
  -Shares split-> color: teal
